  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [places.js](https://community.algolia.com/places) ([source](https://togithub.com/algolia/places)) | devDependencies | minor | [`1.16.6` -> `1.17.0`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/places.js/1.16.6/1.17.0) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>algolia/places</summary>\n\n### [`v1.17.0`](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;1170httpsgithubcomalgoliaplacescomparev1166v1170-2019-10-28)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/compare/v1.16.6...v1.17.0)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **get-val:** call autocompleteInstance.val instead ac.autocomplete.getVal ([#&#8203;919](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/issues/919)) ([6621655](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/commit/662165568edd5fcbd7e51ace2d75a20709500cf8))\n\n##### Features\n\n-   **accessibility:** allow modification of attributes on pin and clear buttons ([#&#8203;920](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/issues/920)) ([41cbd09](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/commit/41cbd09718d3109e364da91af27b8f9bdff4667c))\n\n#### [1.16.6](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/compare/v1.16.5...v1.16.6) (2019-10-09)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **typings:** include types field in package.json ([#&#8203;907](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/issues/907)) ([4d70e28](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/commit/4d70e28))\n\n#### [1.16.5](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/compare/v1.16.4...v1.16.5) (2019-09-30)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **autocomplete-css:** use babel transpiling for places.css ([#&#8203;887](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/issues/887)) ([fcc7112](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/commit/fcc7112))\n-   **deps:** update dependency autocomplete.js to ^0.37.0 ([d03e08f](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/commit/d03e08f))\n-   **rate-limit-ci:** Use authenticated places app in E2E tests ([#&#8203;893](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/issues/893)) ([6a9e506](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/commit/6a9e506))\n\n#### [1.16.4](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/compare/v1.16.3...v1.16.4) (2019-04-15)\n\n##### Features\n\n-   **invalid-credentials:** clearer warning message in console ([#&#8203;768](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/pull/768)) ([e68b1e8](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/commit/e68b1e8))\n\n#### [1.16.3](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/compare/v1.16.2...v1.16.3) (2019-04-01)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **set-val-icon:** show correct icon when calling setVal ([#&#8203;760](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/issues/760)) ([3050e15](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/commit/3050e15))\n\n#### [1.16.2](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/compare/v1.16.1...v1.16.2) (2019-04-01)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **empty-postcode-list:** fix a bug where an empty postcode list could crash results ([#&#8203;759](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/issues/759)) ([a9228a4](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/commit/a9228a4))\n\n#### [1.16.1](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/compare/v1.15.5...v1.16.1) (2019-02-25)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **deps:** update dependency autocomplete.js to ^0.36.0 ([2b0e06c](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/commit/2b0e06c))\n\n##### Features\n\n-   **controlled-search:** expose search method in places.js ([#&#8203;659](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/issues/659)) ([4ddd681](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/commit/4ddd681))\n\n#### [1.15.5](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/compare/v1.15.4...v1.15.5) (2019-02-05)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **promise-polyfill:** remove babel-polyfill and let babel do magic ([#&#8203;726](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/issues/726)) ([be9170b](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/commit/be9170b))\n\n#### [1.15.4](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/compare/v1.15.3...v1.15.4) (2019-01-21)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **babel-node:** make [@&#8203;babel](https://togithub.com/babel)/polyfill a main dependency ([#&#8203;713](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/issues/713)) ([5cc9209](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/commit/5cc9209))\n\n#### [1.15.3](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/compare/v1.15.2...v1.15.3) (2019-01-21)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **node-support:** fix a critical bug where missing polyfills were crashing the library ([#&#8203;712](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/issues/712)) ([2a2f808](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/commit/2a2f808))\n\n#### [1.15.2](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/compare/v1.15.1...v1.15.2) (2019-01-18)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **deps:** update dependency autocomplete.js to ^0.35.0 ([8ee0889](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/commit/8ee0889))\n-   **ie-11-support:** Ensure that places.js and the website can run on IE 11 ([#&#8203;707](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/issues/707)) ([a20ce08](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/commit/a20ce08))\n-   **ie11-logo:** fix algolia logo rendering on IE 11 ([#&#8203;575](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/issues/575)) ([009d26c](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/commit/009d26c))\n\n#### [1.15.1](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/compare/v1.15.0...v1.15.1) (2018-12-14)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **caching:** disable autocomplete caching ([#&#8203;678](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/issues/678)) ([30b516a](https://togithub.com/algolia/places/commit/30b516a))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://togithub.com/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
